<figure id="Pt0.A3.T9" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption" style="font-size:80%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 9: </span><em id="Pt0.A3.T9.17" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Comparison on per-class semantic segmentation performance</em> (mIoU in %) <em id="Pt0.A3.T9.18" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">using DeepLabV3+</em> <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib3" title="" class="ltx_ref">3</a>]</cite>.
Our method is compared to five competing image translation methods, translating from two synthetic datasets to ACDC <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib32" title="" class="ltx_ref">32</a>]</cite>. The best approach is highlighted in <span id="Pt0.A3.T9.19" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">bold</span>, the second best <span id="Pt0.A3.T9.20" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">underlined</span>.</figcaption>
